sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Payment Service Component
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Transaction Boundary
    participant Outbox as Outbox Table
    participant Worker as Outbox Poller Worker
    participant Bus as Message Event Bus

    App->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    App->>DB: UPDATE payments SET status = 'EXECUTED'
    App->>Outbox: INSERT INTO outbox_events (event_id, payload)
    App->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    Worker->>Outbox: SELECT * FROM outbox_events WHERE processed = false FOR UPDATE
    Worker->>Bus: Publish Event Payload
    Worker->>Outbox: UPDATE outbox_events SET processed = true
